  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PODER Core 2022-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Christian Aid and PODER commit to work in partnership together to achieve change in the following areas/ways:
- Seeking a more accountable private sector, particularly in the LAC region. This should include topics such as integrating human rights in the energy transition; gender impacts of corporate human rights abuses: uncovering and addressing structural causes of corporate human rights abuses: and&#xa0;bringing about systemic change.&#xa0;&#xa0;
- Countering private capture of public decision-making and ensuring democratic accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
